\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God of almighty love,
\par By whose sufficient grace
\par I lift my heart to things above,
\par And humbly seek Thy face:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Through Jesus Christ the Just
\par My faint desires receive,
\par And let me in Thy goodness trust
\par And to Thy glory live.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Whate'er I say or do,
\par Thy glory be my aim;
\par My offerings all be offered through
\par The ever-blessed name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Jesu; my single eye
\par Be fixed on Thee alone:
\par Thy name be praised on earth, on high;
\par Thy will by all be done.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Spirit of faith, inspire
\par My concecrated heart;
\par Fill me with pure, celestial fire,
\par With all Thou hast and art.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

